type: dataset
title: "UK Online Shelf-Price Index"
abstract: "A weekly index of posted online shelf prices at Tesco, Sainsbury's, Asda and Aldi: products matched week on week, chained from a base of 100. It measures posted online shelf prices, not prices paid, and it is not a consumer prices index."
authors:
  - name: "Yappman Data"
    website: "https://data.yappman.com/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://data.yappman.com/shelf-price-index/"
keywords:
  - price index
  - groceries
  - shelf prices
  - United Kingdom
  - open data
